r 2.0","Flex Liquid Glass sanayikidwe. Pitani ku Discord pa izi.","Flex ULTIMATE moyo wonse","Flex sangathe kufika pa bolodi lanu chifukwa Node.js azimitsidwa pagululi. Yambitsani Node.js muzokonda zanu CEP, kenaka yambitsaninso After Effects.","Flex sanamvetse yankho la After Effects. Yambitsaninso After Effects ndikuyesanso. Tsatanetsatane:","Flex sinathe kusintha vesi ili kukhala SVG. Yesani kuziyika ngati PNG m'malo mwake. Tsatanetsatane:","Flex sinathe kutsegula chithunzi cha bolodi. Zitha kukhala zamtundu Flex sizigwirizana - yesani kuzikopera ngati PNG.","Flex sinathe kukonza chithunzi cha bolodi. Koperaninso, kenaka muyiike. Tsatanetsatane:","Flex sanathe kuwerenga fayilo kuchokera pa bolodi lanu. Koperani fayiloyo kachiwiri, ndikuyima.","Flex sanathe kuwerenga chithunzicho pa bolodi lanu. Koperaninso, kenaka muyiike.","Flex sinathe kusunga vesi losinthidwa. Onetsetsani kuti muli ndi malo a disk ndi chilolezo cholembera fodayi. Tsatanetsatane:","Flex sinathe kusunga chithunzi chonama. Onetsetsani kuti muli ndi malo a disk ndi chilolezo cholembera fodayi. Tsatanetsatane:","Flex sinathe kusintha chithunzi cha bolodi kukhala fayilo. Koperaninso, kenaka muyiike.","Flex sanathe kudziwa komwe angasungire chithunzicho. Sungani polojekiti yanu, ndikuyesanso.","Flex sanathe kudziwa komwe angasungire chithunzicho. Sungani polojekiti yanu, ndikuyesanso. Tsatanetsatane:","Flex ndiye wabwino kwambiri ...","Flex idataya kulumikizidwa ku After Effects. Tsekani gululo ndikutsegulanso, kapena yambitsaninso After Effects.","Flex ikufunika pulojekiti yotseguka isanamame. Tsegulani kapena pangani polojekiti, kenako yesaninso.","Flex akufuna kunena Chinachake","FlexPack ilibe kanthu.","Flip Horizontal kudzera mu Scale -X","Flip Vertical kudzera mu Scale -Y","Kuyenda & Kuchepetsa","Flow editor mode","Dzina lachikwatu silingakhale ndi zodula.","Dzina lachikwatu...","Foda yasankhidwa bwino!","Tsatirani","Mafonti","Ma Font Family","Font Replacer","Foda ya font sinapezeke","Font iday